  "content": {
    "equation": "Total_Osm = Amino_Acids + Dextrose + Lipids + (1.46 * Calcium_Chloride) + (1.46 * Calcium_Gluconate) + (2 * Potassium_Chloride) + (2 * Potassium_Acetate) + (2.47 * Potassium_Phosphate) + Magnesium_Sulfate + (2 * Sodium_Chloride) + (2 * Sodium_Acetate) + (4 * Sodium_Phosphate)\nTotal_Volume_of_Base_Solution = Total_Volume\nTPN_Osmolarity = 1000 * Total_Osm / Total_Volume",
    "notes": [
      "Central line administration is recommended for solutions with osmolarity greater than 900 mOsm/L.",
